    href: '/career-resources/prompt-engineering-for-non-technical-professionals/',
    title: 'Prompt Engineering for Non-Technical Professionals',
    description: 'Use this if the automation goal keeps failing because the prompts are still too vague or inconsistent.',
  },
  {
    href: '/career-resources/using-ai-tools-without-getting-replaced/',
    title: 'Using AI Tools Without Getting Replaced',
    description: 'Open this if you want to reclaim time without training the market to value your role less.',
  },
  {
    href: '/career-resources/night-shift-plan-learn-7pm-11pm-without-burning-out/',
    title: 'Night Shift Plan',
